OL,3,GNEWSADisco to help people 'process
OL,4,Agrief through dance'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disco is to be held for people to
OL,7,Fhonour and celebrate loved ones who
OL,8,Fhave died while also processing their
OL,9,Fgrief through dance.
OL,11,FJersey Hospice Care's Community
OL,12,FBereavement Service will host the
OL,13,Fisland's first grief disco at House of
OL,14,FChampions in St Helier on 3 October
OL,15,Fbetween 14:00 and 16:30 BST.
OL,17,FThe hospice hopes the event will create
OL,18,F"a safe, compassionate space for people
OL,19,Fto process grief through dance music,
OL,20,Fmovement, and connection". It said
OL,21,Fwhile the event was "not therapy, it
OL,22,Fcould be deeply therapeutic".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
