OL,3,GNEWSADisco to help people 'process
OL,4,Agrief through dance'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe disco idea was started by Georgina
OL,7,FJones and Leah Sian Davies in Cardiff,
OL,8,FWales, in 2024, following their own
OL,9,Flosses. They said dance and music
OL,10,Fhelped them with their own grief.
